    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from General Dynamics Information Technology?",
      "a": "Department of Defense is the largest buyer of General Dynamics Information Technology in FY2026 to date, obligating $1.1B. General Services Administration and Department of Health and Human Services are the next largest buyers at $759M and $750M respectively. Additional buyers include Department of Veterans Affairs at $162M, Department of State at $137M, and Department of the Interior at $136M."
